<title>USA: American Electromedics CEO resigns.</title>
<headline>American Electromedics CEO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>AMHERST, N.H. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Electromedics Corp said Friday that President and Chief Executive Noel Wren resigned.</p>
<p>The company said Chief Financial Officer Michael Pieniazek was elected to the additional post of president.</p>
<p>The company said it will not fill the CEO position.</p>
<p>No further information was provided about Wren's resignation.</p>
</text>
